OL,3,GNEWSAParents want rethink on scrapped
OL,4,Asecondary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents living on a new build housing
OL,7,Festate said they were disappointed
OL,8,Ffunding had been withdrawn for a
OL,9,Fsecondary school.
OL,11,FIn February, the Department for
OL,12,FEducation (DfE) decided not to go ahead
OL,13,Fwith Dallington Park School in
OL,14,FNorthampton, which would have created
OL,15,Fup to 900 places and helped meet demand
OL,16,Ffrom new housing in the area, including
OL,17,Fthe Dallington Grange Development of
OL,18,F3,000 homes.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
