OL,3,GNEWSAParents want rethink on scrapped
OL,4,Asecondary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FMum-of-two Daniela Oanta started a
OL,7,Fpetition calling for a review of the
OL,8,Fdecision she said: "I feel very
OL,9,Fdisappointed, I feel that [moving here]
OL,10,Fwas the worst decision we could ever
OL,11,Fmake."
OL,13,FWest Northamptonshire Council said
OL,14,Fthere was "sufficient secondary school
OL,15,Fcapacity" at local schools.
